      col
        h1 Minimal CSS Framework for Semantic HTML
        text A minimalist and lightweight starter kit that prioritizes semantic syntax, making every HTML element responsive and elegant by default.
        text Write HTML, Add Pico CSS, and Voilà!
        row
          button "Get Started" primary
          button Examples primary
